<title>UK: Tuapse oil pipeline repairs over, Ventspils reopen.</title>
<headline>Tuapse oil pipeline repairs over, Ventspils reopen.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Crude oil deliveries to Russia's refinery at the Black Sea port of Tuapse resumed early on Thursday after a two-day shutdown for maintenance, a shipping source said.</p>
<p>The pipeline reopened at 0830 local time on Thursday after closing at 0945 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Other Black Sea oil terminals at Novorossiisk and Odessa were operating, as was the Baltic port of Ventspils which reopened after a brief closure because of thick fog, the source said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7930</p>
